# Global Filter Scrollability & Consistency Update (Phase 2)

## Goal Description
Ensure all filter dropdowns across the entire application are scrollable, visually consistent, and use the premium custom dropdown styling. This phase completes the refactoring for [manage-data.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/manage-data.html) and standardizes the dropdown handlers in [dashboard.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard.js) and [carbon-intensity.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/carbon-intensity.js).

## Proposed Changes

---

### [Manage Data](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/manage-data.html)
Summary of changes:
- Convert remaining native `<select>` for units in the conversion helper to custom dropdowns.
- Standardize the [setupCustomDropdown](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/emissions-calc.js#1342-1376) initialization.

#### [MODIFY] [manage-data.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/manage-data.html)
- Replace `<select id="conv-oil-unit">` and `<select id="conv-gas-unit">` with custom dropdown wrappers and hidden inputs.
- Update [initCustomDropdowns](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/manage-data.html#1329-1360) to initialize these new wrappers.

---

### [Dashboard Consistency](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard.js)
Summary of changes:
- Refactor the manual toggle/event logic for top filters to use the shared [setupCustomDropdownHelper](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard.js#587-618) function.

#### [MODIFY] [dashboard.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard.js)
- Update [initDashboard](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard.js#23-232) to call [setupCustomDropdownHelper](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard.js#587-618) for `activity-selector-wrapper`, `division-selector-wrapper`, and `facility-selector-wrapper`.
- Remove manual [setupToggle](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard.js#47-57) and manual class management for these wrappers.

---

### [Carbon Intensity Consistency](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/carbon-intensity.js)
Summary of changes:
- Standardize all filter and year dropdowns to use [setupCustomDropdownHelper](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard.js#587-618).

#### [MODIFY] [carbon-intensity.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/carbon-intensity.js)
- Refactor [setupDropdownHandlers](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/carbon-intensity.js#92-154) and [populateYears](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/carbon-intensity.js#23-61) to use [setupCustomDropdownHelper](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard.js#587-618).
- Remove manual toggle and "click outside" listeners that are now redundant.

---

